      {
        "id": 126128,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-17T22:34:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"cmschex\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e9bcb4/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> cmschex:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Arrow/Flash are the only good things DC has right now. &nbsp;I don't have much hope for the movies, as Zach Snyder is prominently involved</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah the newer superman movie was really a let down for me. Script was poor and ultimatly anticlimatic. He is writing the new batman v superman movie, and my fear is it will try and do way too much and spread itself too thin (look at how Sucker Punch turned out). Great movie visually and thematically, but just poorly executed from a story standpoint.&nbsp;</p>",
