      {
        "id": 126130,
        "name": "bessyrocks12",
        "username": "bessyrocks12",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bessyrocks12/{size}/2447_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-19T18:42:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"cmschex\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e9bcb4/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> cmschex:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Arrow/Flash are the only good things DC has right now. &nbsp;I don't have much hope for the movies, as Zach Snyder is prominently involved</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Snyder doesn't know how to let a plot develop without throwing in a ton of special effects to ruin it. Gothem is a disappointment despite great performances of the Penguin, Bullock, and Gordon. None of the other characters make sense and the story seems slapdash.</p>",
