        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-20T14:53:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is how Gotham should end:</p><p>Batman: I'm here to fight the villains the Gotham P.D. can't take down.</p><p>Gordon: We're actually doing really good.</p><p>Batman: What?</p><p>Gordon: Yeah, we've been fighting crazy, weird villains for years now. Crime went down 20 percent after I became Commissioner. If you want to become a cop, we could use you, but Gotham's doing alright. We had a crazy rough patch for a while where you might've been useful, but we got through it without you and are now one of the strongest police forces in the country.</p><p>Batman: Wow, a lot changed while I was gone. Well, good to know you guys are taking care of my city.</p>",
